title: SalWorkshopTS1
color: green
position: -237,-112
---
<<if get_flag("metSul")>>
<<if $sulSpeak==false>>
	The man acnowledges you without lifting his eyes from his work.
	Sully: Hey Kher, can I help you? 
	<<set $sulSpeak = true>>
<<endif>>
-> How can I get in the workshop?<<if get_flag_uncheck("keys") and get_flag("howOpen")>>
	<<detour sullyGetIn>>
-> Can you give me your keys?<<if get_flag("sullyKeys") and get_flag("howOpen") and get_flag_uncheck("keys")>>
	<<detour sullyKey>>
-> Zoe wants to talk to you. <<if get_flag("zoeAsk")>>
	<<detour sulOfficeReq>>
-> Do you know how can I get an extension? <<if get_flag("deadDad") and get_flag_uncheck("SDA")>>
	<<detour sullyExtension>>
-> Do you know who might have my dad's documents? <<if get_flag("SDA") and get_flag_uncheck("gotExtension")>>
	<<detour sullyHick>>
-> Hey Sul can you help me with the POJ allocation system of the ship?
	<<detour SulAllocation>>
-> Hey Sul, I meant to ask you, would you like to come to dad's funeral?<<if get_flag("gotExtension")>>
	<<detour SulFuneral>>
-> Thanks, see you later.
	<<set $sulSpeak = false>><<return>>
<<jump SalWorkshopTS1>>

<<elseif true>>
	The old man's eyes light up when he sees you.
	Sully: Hey kid you made it.
	Sully: You remember me, right?
	<<detour meetSully>>
	<<jump SalWorkshopTS1>>
<<endif>>
