title: meetSully
position: -796,253
---
<<declare $sulSpeak = true>>
Obviously you remember Sully, I mean you left at 17 not 8, what did he expect.
-> No Sully I don't know who you are.
	The man laugh.
	Sully: You've always been fun, kid.
	Sully: And I see Mars treated you well.
-> Yeah Sully! I remember you.
	The man smiles at you.
	Sully: Yes, kiddo.
	Sully: You look good.
-> You were my father's friend right? 
	The man smiles at you.
	Sully: Yes kiddo.
	Sully: You look good.
<<if set_flag("metSul")>><<endif>>
