title: SulAllocation
---
Sully: Yeah sure kid, basically the various stats all represent different systems of your ship. 
Sully: For example radiation protection helps protect you from radiation on long journeys. 
Sully: Or maneuverability assists you with fine movement.
Sully: Of course allocating correctly is important, but what you do in the situation matters just as much.
===
title: SulFuneral
---
Sully: Obviously kid that's not even a question.
He leans in for a hug.
	-> Sorry Sul, I'm not really the hugging type.
		Dad: Damn kid, didn't think I brought you up to be so cold. 
		He smiles at you. 
		Sully: Just like your father, huh?
		Sully pats you on the shoulder.
		Sully: Let me know the details when you have them.
	-> Hug Sully.
		He holds you for a few seconds and you feel like a kid again, then he lets go.
		Sully: Let me know the details when you have them.
<<if set_flag("sullyRecruit")>><<endif>>
===